        "titolo_orig": "Trump-Xi summit live: US, China leaders to hold talks on trade, tech, Iran",
        "testo_it": "Vertice Trump-Xi a Pechino: i leader discutono di commercio, tecnologia e crisi in Iran.",
        "priorita": "Altissima",
        "id_gruppo": 2,
        "link": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/liveblog/2026/5/14/trump-xi-summit-live-us-china-leaders-to-hold-talks-on-trade-tech-iran?traffic_source=rss",
